** sch_path: /home/rafmag/PDK/General/libraries/SmithChart/SC_Test.sch
**.subckt SC_Test
V2 net1 0 dc 0 ac 1 0 portnum=1 z0=50
V1 net2 0 dc 0 ac 0 0 portnum=2 z0=50
C2 net1 net2 100p
L5 0 net2 68n
R2 net2 0 100k
**** begin user architecture code


.temp 30
.option savecurrents
.save all
.control
  save all

  sp lin 1000 50k 600meg

  remzerovec

  write SC_Test.raw

  quit 0
.endc



**** end user architecture code
**.ends
.end
